以下代码逐字节统计文件长度：

```java
try (InputStream in = Files.newInputStream(p)) {
    int n = 0;
    while (in.read() != -1) n++;
}
```

如果把 `in.read() != -1` 写成 `byte b = (byte) in.read(); if (b != -1) ...`，会出现什么后果？

下面代码本意是把 5 个字节写入文件，实际写到文件里却是 0 字节。找出原因并修正：

```java
ByteBuffer b = ByteBuffer.allocate(16);
b.put("hello".getBytes(StandardCharsets.US_ASCII));
try (FileChannel ch = FileChannel.open(p, CREATE, WRITE)) {
    ch.write(b);
}
```

